    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/8563b10d917b25422cf4b6934f064596.avif?t=1752243901\" /></div><br>Morgenstern is a single and multiplayer rogue lite hack and slay adventure with extraction mechanics created by a team which  served previously as 'Manhunt 2' Lead Animator, 'No Rest For The Wicked' Producer and 'Split Second' Destruction Artists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.poster.avif?t=1752243901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/a62e03d1de3a1432631028251e6371eb.webm?t=1752243901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY</h2>In &quot;Morgenstern,&quot; you'll delve into hand crafted levels and procedurally generated dungeons slaying dangerous foes and valuable treasures. The extraction mechanic requires you to strategically decide when to push forward and when to retreat, adding a layer of tactical depth to the rogue-like experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.poster.avif?t=1752243901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/27ec99bd1665eb212e7f983eb9f0ad2f.webm?t=1752243901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESTRUCTION</h2>The fully destructible world allows you to gather resources, set traps, and forge new paths, making each run a unique adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.poster.avif?t=1752243901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/abaf8f0e950a3deb4f929797678256ff.webm?t=1752243901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PROGRESSION AND CUSTOMIZATION</h2>Level up by completing contracts and earning reputation. Unlock new weapons, spells, and abilities to enhance your character. Craft weapons and spells to customize your build suiting your preferred playstyle, whether it's a powerful mage, a swift rogue, or a resilient warrior.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.poster.avif?t=1752243901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/3461aa3ea92dfcc1442beaee497b5298.webm?t=1752243901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE</h2>Join forces with friends in cooperative mode, or test your skills against other players in intense PvP battles. The game's PvE mode offers challenging encounters against AI enemies, perfect for honing your skills and gathering resources.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.poster.avif?t=1752243901\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627210/extras/7910efe15a39de5322d59a4301f14f4a.webm?t=1752243901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LAST CHANCE</h2>When facing imminent defeat, spawn as a deadly pig, granting you one last chance to overcome your enemies and escape with your loot. This unique mechanic adds an exciting twist to the gameplay, ensuring that no run is ever truly over until the very end.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE ADVENTURE NOW!</h2>Are you ready to inscribe your saga in the chronicles of legend? Download &quot;Morgenstern&quot; now and embark on an epic medieval journey like no other.",
